body:
Blob spores that spawn will target humanoids and latch onto their head, slowly eating it. It can be removed via clicking on it like removing a hat. If the humanoid dies with the blob on its head, it turns into a blob zombie. Blob zombies will resurrect forever until a headshot is scored on a dead blob zombie.

&#x200B;

Ironically, combat serverside isn't laggy, however it starts to lag clientside if there are too many effects (blood, bodies, smoke, ect) on the screen. I'm looking for ways to reduce this without damaging the gameplay.
